  "description": "* Note: This is a promotional short series.*\n\nAfter a life full of hardship and heartache, Chon-Eun Ha died in the hospital all alone. However, she woke up suddenly in a lush forest, reincarnated as a witch an a wonderous fantasy world full of magicians, knights and other creatures. A world so wonderous, in fact, that suddenly she finds a fairy has moved into her house.\n\n\"My brave warrior! I've been waiting for you! I'm sorry I must have startled you!\"\n\nWhat is this fairy doing in my house?!\n\n\"My name is Ariel!\"\n\nNo way, THE heavenly Ariel from the \"Tale of Ariel\"?!\n\n[Original Pre-serialization](https://m.comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list.nhn?titleId=753356)",
